  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. If<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;then the sum of all the elements in the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to _______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "11",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Also given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></math></p><p>Now here by the definition of set &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&#39;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now checking number we will get from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>z</mi></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>o</mi></math>&nbsp;we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>.</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn></math></p><p>Now from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math>&nbsp;onwards we get all number as all number will be of type&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;and from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;remainder get compensated by combination of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mi>z</mi></math>,</p><p>So, except the element&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn></math>, every element of set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;is of the form&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;for some&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>W</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mn>11</mn></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}